Z||000006||theogre||03-26-2000||01:25 PM||||Fan switch on point is 235F. Unless you have the 2 speed fan what was only used in 84 I think. Then turn on is 119F low, 221F high.<P>It's common for Fiero temp to bounce around allot. If you are testing for a problem then lock the fan on, and leave the front hood open. This will insure good air flow. If the thing wants to run hot like this then you have other problems.||||reg||1
